		<!-- the first number is the biggest level (bloom that spans almost the entire screen), the second number is one level up (half as wide), and so on. If you have 8 levels, then you need 9 numbers here. If you specify less numbers, then FWsim just repeats the las tnumber. For example: 5,1 means the biggest level gets 5x the weight, and all other levels get their normal weight. 
